/// Its constructor runs UpdateModule's constructor, clears its own state
/// and adds a logic random value between 0 and the data's
/// \c ScanDelayTime to a per-object counter (see the group page). Its data
/// is AutoPickUpUpdateModuleData. The retail executable's debug strings
/// name its original source file AutoPickUpUpdate.cpp, and Open-BFME-1's
/// \c game/ tree has the class; Zero Hour does not. The module's logic is
/// not described here.
