///
/// Built once per module line by
/// AutoPickUpUpdateModuleData::friend_newModuleData and shared by every
/// object of the template.
///
/// \par Modding
/// INI fields, read from the retail table:
/// - \c ScanDelayTime (a duration), \c PickUpFilter (an object filter) and
///   \c ScanDistance (real);
/// - \c EatObjectEntry, parsed by
///   AutoPickUpUpdateModuleData::iniParseEatObjectEntry. Its line uses the
///   keywords \c MyHealth and \c TargetHealth (percentages) and \c Filter
///   (an object filter), and each such line adds one entry to a list;
