/// BannerCarrierUpdateModuleData::friend_newModuleData and shared by every
/// object of the template.
///
/// \par Modding
/// INI fields, read from the retail table:
/// - durations: \c IdleSpawnRate, \c MeleeFreeUnitSpawnTime,
///   \c DiedRespawnTime and \c MeleeFreeBannerReSpawnTime;
