/// INI fields, read from the retail tables. From the FireWeaponUpdate
/// table: \c FireWeaponNugget (read by a parser of its own) and
/// \c HeroModeTrigger, \c ChargingModeTrigger and \c AliveOnly (booleans).
/// Own fields: \c Radius (integer), \c ObjectFilter (an object filter) and
/// \c RequiredUpgrade (text). \c RequiredUpgrade is stored as text when the
/// INI is read; this page does not establish when, or whether, a
/// misspelled upgrade name is reported.
///
/// \see DamageFieldUpdate::friend_newModuleInstance

